  "title": "Lemon Chicken Tenders",
  "description": "Baked lemon chicken tenders are easy to make with common pantry ingredients. Seasoned chicken strips are baked and topped with a tasty lemon-curry sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "J Roderick"
  ],
